acakt\u0131r.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEn az 2 y\u0131l makine montaj tecr\u00fcbesine sahip veya mekanik, hidrolik, pn\u00f6matik sistemlere hakim olan,<br />\r\nMYO, Meslek Lisesi mezunu veya Mesleki Yeterlilik Kurumu belgesi olan<br />\r\nTeknik resim bilgisi olan,<br />\r\nYurti\u00e7i/Yurtd\u0131\u015f\u0131 seyahat engeli olmayan,<br />\r\nErkek adaylar i\u00e7in askerlik hizmetini tamamlam\u0131\u015f<br />\r\n\u0130\u015f emirlerine ba\u011fl\u0131 ve teknik resme uygun montaj yapmak,<br />\r\n\u0130\u015f g\u00fcvenli\u011fi kurallar\u0131na uygun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmak,<br />\r\nYurti\u00e7i/Yurtd\u0131\u015f\u0131 m\u00fc\u015fteri saha montajlar\u0131 ve teknik servis hizmetlerinde g\u00f6rev almak.\t\t\t\t<br><br>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"sayfa-sol siyah-font align-left\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"line-height2 padding20 border-radius10 shadow\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bold\">\u0130lan Bilgileri</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold\">Sekt\u00f6r: </span>Makine<br><span class=\"bold\">\u00c7al\u0131\u015fma \u015eekli: </span>Tam Zamanl\u0131<br><span class=\"bold\">\u00c7al\u0131\u015fma Konumu: </span>\u0130\u015f yerinde<br><span class=\"bold\">Maa\u015f: </span>TALEBE G\u00d6RE KARAR VER\u0130LECEK<br><span class=\"bold\">Yan Haklar: </span>Yemek, Servis, Yol \u00dccreti<br><span class=\"bold\">Mesai Saatleri: </span>08:00-18:00<br><span class=\"bold\">Vardiya: </span>Yok<br><span class=\"bold\">Servis G\u00fczergah\u0131: </span>\u0130zban-Menderes<br><span class=\"bold\">\u0130\u015fe Al\u0131nacak Personel Adedi: </span>2<br><span class=\"bold\">\u0130lan Ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7 Tarihi: </span>11/09/2026<br><span class=\"bold\">\u0130lan Biti\u015f Tarihi: </span>10/12/2026<br>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sayfa-sag siyah-font align-left\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"acik_sari line-height2 padding20 border-radius10 shadow\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"bold\">Aranan Nitelikler</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold\">Ya\u015f: </span>20 ile 45 aras\u0131<br><span class=\"bold\">Cinsiyet: </span>Erkek<br><span class=\"bold\">E\u011fitim Seviyesi: </span>Meslek Lisesi<br><span class=\"bold\">Deneyim S\u00fcresi: </span>1-3 y\u0131l<br><span class=\"bold\">Ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u0130l\u00e7e: </span>Bornova, Buca, Gaziemir, Karaba\u011flar, Konak, Menderes, Torbal\u0131<br><span class=\"bold\">S\u00fcr\u00fcc\u00fc Belgesi: </span>B<br><span class=\"bold\">Askerlik Durumu: </span>Yap\u0131ld\u0131<br>\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"beyaz\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"sayfa-sol align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"ilan-detayi.php?i=35679-ustunkarli-makine-as-izmir-menderes-makine-montaj-elemani&islem=basvur\"><div class=\"buton-mavi buton-buyuk\">\u0130lana Ba\u015fvur</div></a>\n\t\t\t\t<br><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold italic\">Bu ilana ba\u015fvurmadan firmaya genel ba\u015fvuru yapmak i\u00e7in:</span><br>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"ilan-detayi.php?i=35679-ustunkarli-makine-as-izmir-menderes-makine-montaj-elemani&islem=genel-basvuru\"><div class=\"buton-sari buton-genel\">Genel Ba\u015fvuru</div></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>\n\t\t</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"beyaz\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tum-sayfa align-left line-height2 padding20 border-radius10 shadow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"mavi1\" href=\"425227-ustunkarli-makine-as-is-ilanlari\" rel=\"external\"><h3 class=\"bold\">Firma Hakk\u0131nda</h3><br>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold\">\u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI MAK\u0130NE A.\u015e.</span></a><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold\">\u00c7al\u0131\u015fan Say\u0131s\u0131:</span> 51-250<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"bold\">Kurulu\u015f Y\u0131l\u0131:</span> 1954<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-justify\">\u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI Makine A.\u015e. 1954 y\u0131l\u0131nda, Aziz \u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI taraf\u0131ndan kurulmas\u0131 ile marangoz makinalar\u0131 imalat\u0131na ba\u015flam\u0131\u015f olup, \u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI grup \u015firketlerinin ana koludur. \u0130zmir Adnan Menderes Havaliman\u0131n\u0131n hemen yan\u0131nda, 20.000 m\u00b2 alan \u00fczerine kurulu fabrikas\u0131nda \u00fcretim faaliyetlerini s\u00fcrd\u00fcrmektedir. Kuruldu\u011fu g\u00fcnden bu yana T\u00fcrk Kereste Sanayisine y\u00f6n veren \u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI, bug\u00fcn; T\u00fcrkiye pazar\u0131n\u0131n % 75?ine hakim ve \u00fcr\u00fcnlerini 30?dan fazla \u00fclkeye ihra\u00e7 eden, d\u00fcnya \u00e7ap\u0131nda da bu sekt\u00f6rdeki ilk 5 aras\u0131nda yer alan bir firma haline gelmi\u015ftir.<br />\r\nFirma bug\u00fcn anahtar teslim projeler ile birlikte kereste, palet, paketleme malzemeleri \u00fcreten her \u00f6l\u00e7ekte kereste fabrikalar\u0131, mobilya \u00fcreticileri vb. kurulu\u015flara g\u00fcn\u00fcm\u00fcz\u00fcn en son yaz\u0131l\u0131m ve donan\u0131m teknolojileri kullanarak h\u0131zl\u0131, teknolojik, ekonomik ve kullan\u0131m\u0131 g\u00fcvenli, bu g\u00fcvenli\u011fi uluslar aras\u0131 normlarda, belgelenmi\u015f a\u011fa\u00e7 i\u015fleme makinalar\u0131 \u00fcretimi yapmaktad\u0131r.\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\t\n\t<section class=\"koyu_gri\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"bold\">Firmaya Ait Di\u011fer \u0130lanlar</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kutu-1li beyaz shadow\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"35677-ustunkarli-makine-as-izmir-menderes-depo-elemani-is-ilani\"><div class=\"kutu-1li-img\"><img width=\"100\" height=\"26\" src=\"images/firmalar/20260911178911489893.jpg\" title=\"\u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI MAK\u0130NE A.\u015e.\" alt=\"\u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI MAK\u0130NE A.\u015e.\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\"></div></a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"35677-ustunkarli-makine-as-izmir-menderes-depo-elemani-is-ilani\" aria-label=\"Depo Eleman\u0131 \u00dcST\u00dcNKARLI MAK\u0130NE A.\u015e.\"><div class=\"kutu-1li-sol\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mavi-font\" title=\"Depo Eleman\u0131\">Depo Eleman\u0131</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"siyah-font\" title=\"\u00dcST\u00dcNKAR